 id  |              title               |         created_at         | generated_by_ai |          generation_id          |              topic               |                 theme                 |                   subtheme                   | duration_minutes | teachers_overview | teachers_notes | student_notes |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       learning_objectives                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              key_concepts                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            real_life_scenarios                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  practical_activities                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |                                                                                                                                                                                assessment_questions                                                                                                                                                                                |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        homework_assignments                                                                                                               